Changes made (Apache License 2.0, section 4(b)):
- every ported skill: a one-line note added at the top of its body naming the
  upstream skill and pointing to LICENSES.md and this NOTICE.
- frontend-design -> skills/design-frontend.md: renamed; frontmatter replaced
  with Crow's; every instruction to load fonts, scripts or styles from a CDN or
  remote host replaced with "reference library assets by name" (the upstream
  text at this commit has none, so its body is otherwise unchanged); the actor
  addressed as "you"; added the section "Using the Design kit in Crow".
- theme-factory -> skills/design-themes.md, lib/themes.json, lib/themes/*.css:
  renamed; frontmatter replaced; the themes' colour values transcribed
  unchanged into lib/themes.json with roles (bg, fg, accent, accent2); each
